index 865fa04..651148d 100644
--- a/CHANGELOG.md
+++ b/CHANGELOG.md
@@ -1,5 +1,9 @@
 # Changelog
 
+## Unreleased
+- **Rules with triggers.** Markdown files in `.agents/rules/` (this project, up to the repository root) or in ORBIX's `rules` folder (every project) start with frontmatter naming a `trigger`: `always_on` (in every request), `model_decision` (the agent sees its description and reads it when it fits), `glob` with `globs:` (added the first time the agent reads or changes a matching file, or you @-mention one) and `manual` (only when you @-mention it by name). `AGENTS.md` and `CLAUDE.md` work as before. `/memory` lists the rules and any file that was skipped.
+- **More hook events and decisions.** New events: `SessionStart`, `PreInvocation` and `PostInvocation` (before and after each model call). Besides exit code 2, a hook can print JSON: `{"decision":"block","reason":"…"}` blocks, `"allow"` passes, `"continue"` keeps a Stop going, and `{"additionalContext":"…"}` adds a note for the agent. Existing hook files keep working.
+
 ## 3.4.0 (2026-11-20)
 - **A desktop shell like the Antigravity App.**
   - A menu row (ORBIX, Workspace, View, Window) and a toolbar: the mark (a new conversation), the sidebar switch, **Back** and **Forward** (Alt+← / Alt+→) across conversations, Runs and Review, search, and where you are: project / conversation, with its state, running time and branch. In the Windows app the menu row is the title bar.
